  "body": "Auction: 62 Highbrook Drive, East Tamaki on Tuesday 17 November 2026 at 1:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSet on 873m² (more or less) in the Mixed Housing Suburban Zone, with services on site, this property presents an exciting opportunity for families, builders and developers. Any future development is subject to council approval.\r\n\r\nWith its backyard facing the park, the home enjoys a lovely green outlook and a peaceful setting for family living. Five bedrooms, two bathrooms and a freestanding double garage provide space and flexibility.\r\n\r\nZoned for sought-after Bucklands Beach Primary School, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Macleans College, this desirable location is within walking distance of Bucklands Beach and Eastern Beach. Howick Golf Club, Half Moon Bay Marina and ferry services are also nearby.\r\n\r\nAfter 25 happy years, the vendors are relocating. Whether you’re looking for a family home, a renovation project or a site to explore future possibilities, this is an opportunity worth viewing.",
